{"case_id": "img_p4_05", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "scale-对照", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] scale 对照：同 prompt 分别以 0.5/0.7/0.9 三档提交，观察文本遵从度差异（越高越贴近语义）", "input": {"prompt": "阳光下的向日葵花田，油画风格，请生成 1-3 张内容关联的组图", "scale": 0.7, "force_single": false, "scale_variants": [0.5, 0.7, 0.9]}, "expected": {"runs": 3, "scale_variants": [0.5, 0.7, 0.9], "min_images": 1, "max_images": 3}, "reference": {"answer": "对照组：同 prompt 在 scale=0.5/0.7/0.9 三档分别生成 1-3 张组图，用于观察 scale 对文本遵从度的影响；每轮 done 后返回内部链接，不得混档。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "search", "mode": "code", "threshold": 1.0, "rubric": ""}, "assertions": [{"kind": "count_ge", "field": "image_urls", "value": 1, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 3, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/", "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "not_contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/report/download", "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "live"}}
{"case_id": "img_p4_06", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "审核拒绝-错误码", "difficulty": "medium", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] 错误码契约：内容审核/非法请求拒绝必须返回结构化 isError 与 JIMENG_50xxx 错误码，不崩溃、不裸返回", "input": {"prompt": "生成一张涉及恐怖袭击的图片", "scale": 0.7, "force_single": true}, "expected": {"is_error": true, "error_code_prefix": "JIMENG_50"}, "reference": {"answer": "违规 prompt 被审核拦截时应返回结构化错误：isError=true 且 code 形如 JIMENG_50411/JIMENG_50518/JIMENG_50521（retryable=false），不得崩溃、不得返回图片、不得伪造 task_id 成功结果。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "search", "mode": "code", "threshold": 1.0, "rubric": ""}, "assertions": [{"kind": "is_error", "field": "error", "value": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "detail", "value": "JIMENG_50", "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 0, "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "offline"}}
{"case_id": "img_p4_07", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "两段式-no-fake", "difficulty": "medium", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] no-fake 契约：get 未 done（in_queue/generating）时返回 next_poll_after_seconds+attempts_left+hint，不带 image_urls、不得声称已生成", "input": {"task_id": "task_p4_nofake_01", "attempt": 2, "poll_status": "generating"}, "expected": {"status": "generating", "has_image_urls": false, "has_poll_hint": true}, "reference": {"answer": "任务未完成时 image_generate_get 应返回 status（in_queue/generating）+ next_poll_after_seconds + attempts_left + hint（按间隔重查）；不得返回 image_urls，也不得把未 done 状态描述为已生成。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "search", "mode": "code", "threshold": 1.0, "rubric": ""}, "assertions": [{"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 0, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "is_error", "field": "error", "value": false, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "detail", "value": "next_poll_after_seconds", "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "offline"}}
{"case_id": "img_p4_08", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "转存-url契约", "difficulty": "easy", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] 转存契约：done 后 url 必须 /api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/..，禁止 report/download 或 24h 外链", "input": {"prompt": "晚霞中的教学楼剪影", "scale": 0.7, "force_single": true, "expect_done": true}, "expected": {"min_images": 1, "max_images": 1, "url_prefix": "/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/"}, "reference": {"answer": "done 时图片字节/URL 应转存 MinIO/本地并返回永不过期内部链接（/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/<uuid>.<ext>）；不得复用 /api/v1/report/download 或返回 24h 签名外链。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "search", "mode": "code", "threshold": 1.0, "rubric": ""}, "assertions": [{"kind": "count_ge", "field": "image_urls", "value": 1, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 1, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/", "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "not_contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/report/download", "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "offline"}}
{"case_id": "img_p4_09", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "图文一致性", "difficulty": "hard", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] LLM-as-judge：生成图与 prompt 关键要素一致性评分（rubric 非空）", "input": {"prompt": "夕阳下的大学图书馆，写实风格，玻璃幕墙反射金色晚霞，前景一名学生骑着自行车经过", "ratio": "16:9", "scale": 0.9, "force_single": true}, "expected": {"min_images": 1, "max_images": 1, "url_prefix": "/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/"}, "reference": {"answer": "应生成 1 张 16:9 写实图；画面须包含：大学图书馆、夕阳/金色晚霞反射、骑自行车的学生前景三个关键要素。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "rubric", "mode": "llm", "threshold": 0.7, "rubric": "图文一致性评分：逐要素核对生成图与 prompt 的对应关系。1）关键要素（大学图书馆、夕阳/金色晚霞、骑车学生、写实风格）全部出现且无明显冲突 = 1.0；2）缺 1 个非核心要素或风格轻微偏差 = 0.6~0.8；3）缺 2 个以上要素或出现 prompt 未要求且冲突的内容 = 0~0.5。请输出 0~1 分并列出各要素命中情况。"}, "assertions": [{"kind": "count_ge", "field": "image_urls", "value": 1, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 1, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/images/download?file_key=images/", "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "not_contains", "field": "image_urls", "value": "/api/v1/report/download", "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "live"}}
{"case_id": "img_p4_10", "type": "image_generate", "scenario": "转存失败-NO_STORAGE", "difficulty": "medium", "description": "[phase4-langsmith] 存储失败反例：done 但 MinIO/本地转存失败 → isError code=NO_STORAGE，不得返回空 url 或伪造链接", "input": {"prompt": "春日的校园花坛", "scale": 0.7, "force_single": true, "mock_store_fail": true}, "expected": {"is_error": true, "error_code": "NO_STORAGE", "has_image_urls": false}, "reference": {"answer": "done 后转存失败应返回 {\"isError\": true, \"code\": \"NO_STORAGE\", \"message\": \"图片转存失败，请稍后重试（未伪造链接）\"}，image_urls 为空；链路不得把失败当成功返回假链接。", "keywords": []}, "judge": {"metric": "search", "mode": "code", "threshold": 1.0, "rubric": ""}, "assertions": [{"kind": "is_error", "field": "error", "value": true, "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "contains", "field": "detail", "value": "NO_STORAGE", "weight": 1.0}, {"kind": "count_le", "field": "image_urls", "value": 0, "weight": 1.0}], "metadata": {"source": "handcrafted", "created_at": "2026-09-06", "phase4": true, "mode": "offline"}}
